INSERT OR IGNORE INTO stories (id, slug, lane, type, section_slug, status, sensitive, headline, dek, body, byline, hero_image_url, hero_image_credit, hero_image_rights, source_system, source_ref, priority, is_lead_candidate, created_by, created_at, updated_at) VALUES ('bd-20261123-bruins-lindholm-four-goals', 'bruins-beat-capitals-7-5-elias-lindholm-four-goals-td-garden', 'newsroom', 'news_story', 'nhl', 'EDITORIAL_REVIEW', 0, 'Elias Lindholm scores four goals as the Bruins beat the Capitals 7-5', 'Lindholm set a career high on Saturday, Nov. 21, at TD Garden, and David Pastrnak added three points as Boston won its second straight.', 'Elias Lindholm scored four goals and added an assist on Saturday, Nov. 21, as the Boston Bruins beat the Washington Capitals 7-5 at TD Garden, according to NHL.com and the Associated Press.

## Lindholm''s night

It was a career high for Lindholm and his first hat trick with Boston. His goals came on a power-play tip in the first period, a goal for a 4-2 lead in the second, a deflection of a Connor Clifton shot for a 5-4 lead late in the second, and a redirect of a David Pastrnak shot for a 6-4 lead early in the third. NHL.com said he is the third Bruins player since the 2021-22 season with a four-goal game.

Pastrnak had a goal and two assists. Morgan Geekie and Charlie McAvoy each had three assists, and McAvoy reached 301 career assists. Tanner Jeannot scored, and Fraser Minten added an empty-net goal. Jeremy Swayman made 30 saves.

## Washington

Tom Wilson, Dylan Strome, Jakob Chychrun, Alex Tuch (short-handed) and Pierre-Luc Dubois scored for the Capitals. Charlie Lindgren made 16 saves. Washington has lost five in a row and allowed 30 goals in that stretch.

## Standings and next game

The Bruins are 15-7-1 and have won two straight. The Capitals are 10-11-0. Boston hosts the Winnipeg Jets on Wednesday, Nov. 25.', 'Boston Daily Staff', 'https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/5/56/Ice_Hockey_Game_-_Madison_Square_Garden_-_Boston_vs_New_York.jpg/1280px-Ice_Hockey_Game_-_Madison_Square_Garden_-_Boston_vs_New_York.jpg', 'Boston vs. New York ice hockey game at Madison Square Garden (historic file photo, not from this game). Wikimedia Commons; editor to confirm the public-domain status on the file page before release', 'public_domain', 'newsroom', 'content/2026-11-23.sql', 7, 0, 'newsroom-assistant', '2026-11-23T11:00:00.000Z', '2026-11-23T11:00:00.000Z');
